  "comment": {
    "text": "Title of the create option on the empty screen of the Skill sets list in the AI Chat section, shown above a one-line description; clicking it opens the form that creates a skill set. Short label, adjective + noun, no verb, no full stop. Skill set = a room of skills (Markdown instructions); the adjective agrees with it. Match Common:SkillSets and Common:CreateSkillSet.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T12:44:04.019Z",
